            "body": "> :h progress-message\n\nThanks for the reply. I'm new to Neovim and a bit confused — this seems like a feature that plugins have to actively call, but I never configured anything and it still shows up.\n\nI want to disable it, but the docs don't mention how. Is there any way to do this?\n\nAlso, why doesn't it show up in tmux or Alacritty?",
